{"v":1,"tab":"peliculas","at":1795461665564,"rows":[{"id":"peliculas","title":"Películas","items":[{"id":"m-you-are-the-apple-of-my-eye-sub-espanol","ref":"m:you-are-the-apple-of-my-eye-sub-espanol","title":"You Are the Apple of My Eye","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KRfPg3ntKhl8AzVSqoXhgj8t78.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pCRfOsHdGeaGc8BXuhlhzmWHy3E.jpg","year":"2025","rating":8.4,"overview":"A group of close friends who attend a private school all have a debilitating crush on the sunny star pupil, Sun-ah. The only member of the group who claims not to is Jin-woo, but he ends up loving her as well.","ids":{"tmdb":1290182}},{"id":"m-this-is-i-sub-espanol","ref":"m:this-is-i-sub-espanol","title":"This Is I","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nTqw569IFEZtCMKaRYPH2vnEzG.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6aa0MMYI0cnrAw2ra3E5CmfHfUV.jpg","year":"2026","rating":7.1,"overview":"Tras descubrir un sentido de pertenencia en un cabaré y recibir ayuda de un médico, Kenji, un chico acosado por querer ser una estrella, saca a la luz su verdadero ser, Ai Haruna.","ids":{"tmdb":1570282}},{"id":"m-peligrosa-obsesion-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"m:peligrosa-obsesion-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Peligrosa obsesión","kind":"movie","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYrFH2WlCEUNuR85JturV77uOBU.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aQzXICKh3oaJanWSsSRJ2epB9Z5.jpg","year":"2014","rating":6.7,"overview":"En el verano de 1969, el coronel Kim Jin Pyung luchó con valentía en la guerra de Vietnam. Sin embargo, vive atrapado en un matrimonio sin amor con Soo Jin. En un complejo de viviendas de la familia militar, el coronel se enamora de Jong Ga Heun, la esposa de su subordinado, y mantienen un apasionado romance secreto.","ids":{"tmdb":269955}},{"id":"m-obsessed-sub-espanol","ref":"m:obsessed-sub-espanol","titl