,"year":"2023","rating":7.6,"overview":"La ex-campeona de boxeo So Si Min (Shin Hae Sun) ahora trabaja como profesora de secundaria. A pesar de los frecuentes casos de acoso entre estudiantes, Si Min mantiene la cabeza baja y evita intervenir, por miedo a poner en peligro sus posibilidades de convertirse en profesora titular a tiempo completo. Sin embargo, llega a su límite cuando Han Su Gang (Lee Jun Young) lleva su acoso demasiado lejos y Si Min se ve incapaz de permanecer como espectadora. Película adaptada del webtoon del mismo nombre de Kim Jung Hyun.","ids":{"tmdb":897160}},{"id":"m-true-beauty-the-movie-part-2-sub-espanol","ref":"m:true-beauty-the-movie-part-2-sub-espanol","title":"True Beauty: The Movie - Part 2","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/true-beauty-the-movie-part-2-1764452172.webp?v=1.5","ids":{"tmdb":1363903}},{"id":"m-true-beauty-the-movie-part-1-sub-espanol","ref":"m:true-beauty-the-movie-part-1-sub-espanol","title":"True Beauty: The Movie - Part 1","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZLsjQUQuMpfNGAIq5TtuWTpZnu.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qqKsRpXaLojlGhTVUmVZC8e6rt5.jpg","year":"2025","rating":6.4,"overview":"Reina, who feels insecure about her looks, masters the art of makeup and transforms into a \"goddess\". Her makeover sparks a sweet, heart-throbbing love triangle with the enigmatic Shun and warm Yu, where secrets and tender emotions could change everything."},{"id":"m-the-gangster-the-cop-the-devil-sub-espanol","ref":"m:the-gangster-the-cop-the-devil-sub-espanol","title":"The Gangster, the Cop, the Devil","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHlM4abRm6BzrRcz9Nup1uidw9H.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jJJQ1PPXUEchqyZ9YyWzgSNU39Z.jpg","year":"2019","rating":7.9,"overview":"After barely surviving a brutal attack by a sadistic serial killer, crime boss Jang Dong-su is left humiliated. Determined to catch the killer known as K, he forms an uneasy alliance with Jung Tae-seok, a relentless and incorruptible detective who often disrupts his illegal business. However, while Jang Dong-su wants K dead, Jung Tae-suk is determined to bring him to justice. With a deal in place—whoever finds K first will decide his fate—the hunt begins, blurring the lines between crime and law."},{"id":"m-brave-citizen-sub-espanol","ref":"m:brave-citizen-sub-espanol","title":"Brave Citizen","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixQoOExnnvIxYvnqGgfhaWqXeXc.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fJRrRn60YzI1hVt4X1BIo6hsM0g.jpg","year":"2023","rating":7.6,"overview":"An expelled boxing champion, who now is a high-school teacher, witnesses intolerable violence and throws her first punch to build justice against it, while putting on a mask."},{"id":"m-mischievous-kiss-love-in-tokyo-sub-espanol","ref":"m:mischievous-kiss-love-in-tokyo-sub-espanol","title":"Mischievous Kiss: Love in Tokyo","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/mischievous-kiss-love-in-tokyo-1760824718.webp?v=1.5"},{"id":"m-hell-is-other-people-sub-espanol","ref":"m:hell-is-other-people-sub-espanol","title":"Hell is Other People","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/hell-is-other-people-1758859379.webp?v=1.5"},{"id":"m-atrapada-2019-sub-espanol","ref":"m:atrapada-2019-sub-espanol","title":"Atrapada (2019)","kind":"movie","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/atrapada-2019-1752357525.webp?v=1.5"},{"id":"m-hataraku-saibou-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"m:hataraku-saibou-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Hataraku saibou","kind":"movie","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/hataraku-saibou-latino-1749850500.webp?v=1.5"},{"id":"m-cells-at-work-sub-espanol","ref":"m